<title>BELGIUM: BANKS SIGN 100 MLN DLR CREDIT DEAL FOR BLADEX.</title>
<headline>BANKS SIGN 100 MLN DLR CREDIT DEAL FOR BLADEX.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A consortium of 15 international banks led by Belgium's Kredietbank SA have agreed a 100 million dollar credit line for Banco Latino Americano de Exportaciones SA (BLADEX), Kredietbank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Belgian bank said the credit line was the second for BLADEX this year.</p>
<p>It added that Panama-based BLADEX was considered in financial circles as a supranational bank specialising in the short-term financing of Latin American exports.</p>
